{
  "key": 35762,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_BattleFrontiersTough",
      "en_US": [
        "The Battle Frontier’s as tough as they\n",
        "say...\r",
        "None of the facilities are cakewalks,\n",
        "that’s for sure."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_BestTrainersAtBattleZone",
      "en_US": [
        "The best Trainers from around the\n",
        "country...\r",
        "No, the best Trainers from around\n",
        "the world gather at the Battle Zone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_ToToughenMyself",
      "en_US": [
        "To toughen myself!\n",
        "To toughen my Pokémon!\f",
        "For that alone, I have come!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "We’re doing a feature on tough Trainers\n",
        "in the Battle Zone.\r",
        "That’s where you come in.\n",
        "We need you to battle us!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": "Reporter Kinsey’s live interview!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "You don’t have to be shy.\n",
        "We can obscure your face if we have to."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_KinseyPostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "I go after interviews like my favorite\n",
        "Pokémon move--I tackle them!\r",
        "Of course, I don’t use Tackle in\n",
        "battles, though."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_TevinIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Expert Trainer spotted!\n",
        "Will you let us battle with you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_TevinBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Great! Great!\n",
        "You guys are great!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_TevinBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Want to see how good you are before\n",
        "you go off to the Battle Frontier?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_TevinPostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "The combination of you and your Pokémon\n",
        "will tear up the Battle Tower!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignGreninjaOffer",
      "en_US": [
        "My GRENINJA and I came to take on\n",
        "the Battle Frontier together.\r",
        "But it keeps looking at you, as if\n",
        "you two share some kind of bond...\r",
        "Would you take it with you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignGreninjaTakeCare",
      "en_US": [
        "Fight side by side, and it’ll show\n",
        "you power you’ve never seen.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignGreninjaReceived",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received the GRENINJA!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignGreninjaNickname",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you like to give a nickname\n",
        "to the GRENINJA you received?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignGreninjaPartyFull",
      "en_US": [
        "Your party’s full. Come back when\n",
        "you have room for it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignGreninjaDeclined",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh... Well, it’ll be here\n",
        "if you change your mind."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignGreninjaAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "When GRENINJA knocks out a foe at\n",
        "your side, its bond with you grows.\r",
        "Then it takes on a whole new form!"
      ]
    },
